# Unsummon: "Return target creature to its owner's hand." Its only target, Bot2's Llanowar Elves, is Lightning Bolted by Bot2 in response and dies; the Unsummon does not
# resolve (CR 608.2b) and returns nothing, so the Elves is in the graveyard and not in Bot2's hand (Elves back in hand would make it 5, not 4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Unsummon
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Unsummon
